--- a/packages/coding-agent/docs/tui.md
+++ b/packages/coding-agent/docs/tui.md
@@ -765,6 +765,22 @@ ctx.ui.setWidget("my-widget", undefined);
 
 **Examples:** [plan-mode.ts](../examples/extensions/plan-mode.ts)
 
+### Pattern 5b: Transcript modes
+
+Interactive mode can be configured so an extension can own the transcript surface.
+
+```ts
+// Hide live tool rows + thinking placeholders + working spinner row
+ctx.ui.setLiveTranscriptMode({ toolRows: "hide", thinking: "hide", working: "hide" });
+
+// Hide replayed tool rows + thinking placeholders when rebuilding transcript history
+ctx.ui.setHistoricalTranscriptMode({ toolRows: "hide", thinking: "hide" });
+
+// Restore defaults
+ctx.ui.setLiveTranscriptMode();
+ctx.ui.setHistoricalTranscriptMode();
+```
+
 ### Pattern 6: Custom Footer
 
 Replace the footer. `footerData` exposes data not otherwise accessible to extensions.
